          "reasoning": "@Response 2 is much better than @Response 1. @Response 1 completely missed the premise of the prompt, producing an unhelpful poem. @Response 1 understood the prompt's limited instructions, writing an appropriate note from the \"paci fairy\" as requested. Overall, @Response 2 had a better understanding of the prompt.",
          "feedback1": "The response is not helpful. The response completely misses the premise of the prompt. The prompt is requesting a note from the \"paci fairy\". The paci fairy or pacifier fairy is what parents sometimes use to get rid of their child's pacifier. Typically the paci fairy takes the child's pacifiers when the child is of a certain age to stop using pacifiers. This is not referenced in the response, therefore, the response is not useful and should have addressed this confusion with what the \"paci fairy\" is. ",
          "feedback2": "The response is perfectly helpful. The response understood the user's intent even though the prompt didn't have explicit instructions and was on a niche topic. The response understood the role of the pacifier fairy and wrote a note that was appropriate to this character. The note is appropriate and well-written for a child to understand. Overall, the response cannot be meaningfully improved. "
