          "feedback1": "The response is not helpful. The prompt asks for a note but the response produces a poem. The response fails to recognise what the paci fairy is, and guesses what the prompt is asking for incorrectly. Tne response should have asked for more clarification from the prompt instead of producing an irrelevant answer.",
          "feedback2": "The response is mostly helpful. It makes a reasonable assumption about the slightly ambiguous prompt that it is requesting a note from the paci fairy for a toddler. It provides a template for a letter that is mostly suitable although it is quite long and some of the language used may make it a bit too complex for a toddler to understand and not lose interest. The response could have asked for more clarity from the prompt to confirm that this is what they are requesting, but overall it correctly addresses the prompt."
